step Sunken Temple first: fly to Nethergarde Keep, ride north into the Swamp of Sorrows (70, 51)
  zone map 1435
  tip Quests from Feralas (The Sunken Temple) and Un'Goro. · Holy BiS: Shade of Hakkar drops Embrace of the Wind Serpent (Lv 50 chest). · Outside the dungeon. · Grab it if you're going to the Sunken Temple anyway. · Range 50-60. · Kill the Shade of Eranikus.
  task "Sunken Temple (50-60)" optional
  accept 8257 "Blood of Morphaz" map 1447 @42.4,42.6
  task "Sanguine Sorcery (optional)" optional
  task "Legacy: Temple of Atal'Hakkar (Sunken Temple)" optional

step Blood of Morphaz
  zone map 1447
  tip Priest only. · Morphaz is a green drake that shows up in the middle chamber of the Sunken Temple after Jammal'an dies. · Loot the Blood of Morphaz from him and take it to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood (Emerald Sanctuary, 51.2, 82.1). · ~6,350 XP. · Shadow BiS: reward Woestave (wand you keep to 60).
  complete 8257 "Blood of Morphaz"
  turnin 8257 "Blood of Morphaz" npc 10922 "Greta Mosshoof" map 1448 @51.2,82.1

step Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands (43, 84)
  zone map 1422
  tip Bring the Filled Gahrron's Withering Bottle to High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands. · Hand in: High Priestess MacDonnell, Western Plaguelands (43, 84.5). ~3,100 XP. · You need the Skeleton Key to open the door. · The chain starts with Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp, then Alchemist Arbington: Skeletal Fragments (WPL skeletons) → Mold Rhymes With... · Wear the commission (trinket), then turn in Scourgestones for Argent Dawn rep.
