  accept 5343 "Barov Family Fortune" @43.5,83.7
  accept 5382 "Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher" @70.2,73.7
  task "Argent Dawn Commission + Scourgestones" optional

step Clear the Way
  zone map 1422
  tip Kill 10 Skeletal Flayers and 10 Slavering Ghouls in Sorrow Hill. · Needs A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! done first. ~5,100 XP.
  complete 5092 "Clear the Way" @47.3,84.3
  turnin 5092 "Clear the Way" @42.7,84.0

