step Barov Family Fortune
  zone map 1422
  tip The 4 deeds are papers on tables inside Scholomance. · Brill: the Laboratory, halfway down on the right. · Tarren Mill: the room right after the Chamber of Summoning, on a table at the far right end. · Southshore: The Reliquary, on a table in the north-east corner. · Caer Darrow: the Barov Family Vault, next to Lord Alexei Barov. · Take them back to Weldon Barov at Chillwind Camp.
  complete 5343 "Barov Family Fortune"
  turnin 5343 "Barov Family Fortune" @43.5,83.7

step Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher
  zone map 1422
  tip Krastinov is in the Butcher's Sanctum in Scholomance. · Kill him, then click the Remains of Eva Sarkhoff and the Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff in his room to burn them. · Turn in to Eva Sarkhoff's ghost at Caer Darrow. · ~6,600 XP.
  complete 5382 "Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher"
  turnin 5382 "Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher" @70.2,73.7

