step Skeletal Fragments
  zone map 1422
  tip 15 Skeletal Fragments drop from the skeletons in Western Plaguelands (Skeletal Terrors, Warlords, Flayers, Executioners, Sorcerers and Acolytes, mostly around Andorhal). · This is part 2 of the Scholomance key chain. · Next you take the Imbued Skeletal Fragments plus 15 gold to Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan (Mold Rhymes With...). · Then use the mold with 2 Thorium Bars on the shore of the lava lake in front of Blazerunner's cave on Fire Plume Ridge, Un'Goro, out of combat (Fire Plume Forged). · Last, kill Araj the Summoner in Andorhal for Araj's Scarab and turn it in for the Skeleton Key. · ~4,500 XP.
  complete 5537 "Skeletal Fragments" @47.3,84.3
  turnin 5537 "Skeletal Fragments" @42.7,83.8

